Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:04:15.58,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:04:15.58,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}高芙 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}2 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 佩古拉 · 赛后捧杯致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, Coco Gauff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,女士们，先生们，高芙。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:24.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, this is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,呃，这感觉真好。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Where where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,她……她在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:26.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, right here. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:26.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,哦，就在这儿，不好意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:28.72,EN,,0,0,0,,No, first I want to congratulate Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:28.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,不，我想先恭喜杰斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:31.12,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, you're an incredible player,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:31.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你真是个了不起的选手，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:32.08,EN,,0,0,0,,that goes without saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个不用说，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and always playing you is tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,每次和你打都很难打。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:35.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I think today just was I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想今天……我也说不好，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:38.00,EN,,0,0,0,,if all the balls are going in on my side today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,是不是我今天球都进了，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:40.48,EN,,0,0,0,,but I don't like seeing you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:40.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我真不喜欢看到你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:41.92,EN,,0,0,0,,on the other side of the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:41.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,站在球网的另一边。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:44.64,EN,,0,0,0,,So, but I like playing with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:44.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过我喜欢和你打球，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:47.60,EN,,0,0,0,,but yeah, I just want to say congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:47.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,但，我就想说一句恭喜。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:49.52,EN,,0,0,0,,You're incredible person and player
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:49.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你既是好人，也是好选手，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:51.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and congrats to your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:51.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,也恭喜你的团队。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:53.44,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys are also incredible people,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:53.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们也都是了不起的人，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:55.36,EN,,0,0,0,,one of the best teams on tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:55.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,巡回赛里最好的团队之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:57.44,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, also just like to thank Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还想谢谢杰斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:59.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Like she said, when I first came on tour,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:59.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像她说的，刚上巡回赛时，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:01.20,EN,,0,0,0,,she was one of the few players
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:01.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是少数几个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:02.64,EN,,0,0,0,,that was nice to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:02.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我很友善的选手之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:04.96,EN,,0,0,0,,And that's always, no, seriously,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:04.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一直……不，说真的，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.96,0:01:06.96,EN,,0,0,0,,that's always stuck a long way with me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.96,0:01:06.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直伴着我，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:09.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and my family, and I have so much respect
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,也伴着家人，我很尊敬你，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:10.08,EN,,0,0,0,,for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:10.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,真心的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.08,0:01:11.52,EN,,0,0,0,,So, it's an honor to share the court
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.08,0:01:11.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,能和你同场竞技是种荣幸，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:12.88,EN,,0,0,0,,with you once again, and hopefully you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:12.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,很高兴再交手一次，也希望你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:16.88,EN,,0,0,0,,can run it back a couple times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,以后还能再战几回。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:20.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Next I would like to thank my team,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:20.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,接下来我想谢谢我的团队，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.80,0:01:24.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Jaci, Gavin, Maria, Kylin, and Fabian,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.80,0:01:24.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,杰西加文玛丽亚凯琳法比安，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.00,EN,,0,0,0,,who's in France right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,法比安现在人在法国，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:27.60,EN,,0,0,0,,who has been helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,他一直在帮我。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.60,0:01:30.08,EN,,0,0,0,,And my family back at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.60,0:01:30.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有在家里的家人。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:32.16,EN,,0,0,0,,What a difference a year can make.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:32.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,一年的变化真的很大。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.16,0:01:34.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Especially JC was sitting in that box
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.16,0:01:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是 JC，他去年也在场，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:36.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and we were not in a good scenario last
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:36.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,那时候我们的状况并不好，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:39.04,EN,,0,0,0,,year and we brought on Gavin and,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,后来我们请来了加文，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.04,0:01:41.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel like they're the dynamic duo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.04,0:01:41.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得他俩现在是最强搭档。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:44.32,EN,,0,0,0,,So, it's really a great joy to play tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,打网球真的是件很快乐的事，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.32,0:01:45.36,EN,,0,0,0,,you guys make the sport
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.32,0:01:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,是你们让这项运动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.36,0:01:47.92,EN,,0,0,0,,so fun for me and I think along
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.36,0:01:47.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说变得这么有趣，我想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:49.44,EN,,0,0,0,,with that that's just helped me become
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:49.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这也帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:51.12,EN,,0,0,0,,a better player in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,成为了场下更好的自己。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:55.04,EN,,0,0,0,,So thank you guys for holding it down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:55.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们一直撑着这一切，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.04,0:01:57.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and thank you to my parents back at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.04,0:01:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,也谢谢在家的爸爸妈妈，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:01:59.68,EN,,0,0,0,,my brothers, grandparents, all the family
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:01:59.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的兄弟们、祖父母、所有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:01.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and friends that have been cheering for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:01.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直为我加油的家人朋友，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,praying for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直在为我祈祷。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:03.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I facetimed them after the right there
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛后我在场边的椅子上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:04.56,EN,,0,0,0,,on the bench.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:04.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,就跟他们视频通话了，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:06.48,EN,,0,0,0,,So it was good to see their their faces
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:06.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,能看到他们的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:07.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and them smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,看到他们笑，感觉真好。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.92,0:02:10.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Usually I just get a good job text, so it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.92,0:02:10.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,平常只收到「打得不错」，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:12.32,EN,,0,0,0,,was nice to get a little bit more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:12.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,这次能多一点，感觉很好。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:15.76,EN,,0,0,0,,And I would like
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:15.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:18.96,EN,,0,0,0,,to thank God for just bringing me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,感谢上帝，是他带我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.96,0:02:20.80,EN,,0,0,0,,through this these tough periods.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.96,0:02:20.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,走过了这些艰难的日子。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:23.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Last year was literally in the parking lot like
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:23.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,去年我真的就是在停车场里，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.92,0:02:24.64,EN,,0,0,0,,in tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.92,0:02:24.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,哭得一塌糊涂。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:26.40,EN,,0,0,0,,So it's it's a big difference what a year
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:26.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,一年真能带来这么大的不同，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:26.80,EN,,0,0,0,,can make.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:26.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:29.20,EN,,0,0,0,,So I thank him for pulling me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:29.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我谢谢他把我拉了过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:31.44,EN,,0,0,0,,And I would also like to thank Bob
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还想谢谢鲍勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:34.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and Pam for putting on, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:34.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,和帕姆，谢谢他们办了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:35.20,EN,,0,0,0,,a great tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:35.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,这么一届精彩的赛事，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:37.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and and definitely like Jess said,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有，就像杰斯说的那样，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:39.52,EN,,0,0,0,,the Navarros for investing in tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:39.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,也谢谢纳瓦罗一家投资网球，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:40.80,EN,,0,0,0,,especially women's tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是女子网球。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:45.76,EN,,0,0,0,,It's so important and this tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,这真的很重要，这项赛事，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:47.84,EN,,0,0,0,,the investment that they made to our sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:47.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们对这项运动的投入，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:49.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I think all the players feel the love here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:49.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,球员都感受到了这份爱。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:51.60,EN,,0,0,0,,It's one of the easiest tournaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:51.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是最舒心的赛事之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.60,0:02:54.16,EN,,0,0,0,,And I always enjoy coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.60,0:02:54.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直很喜欢来这儿。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:56.00,EN,,0,0,0,,And thank you to all the volunteers,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:56.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,也谢谢所有志愿者，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:57.44,EN,,0,0,0,,the ball kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢捡球的孩子们。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.44,0:03:00.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know, drivers, the valet drivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.44,0:03:00.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有司机、代客泊车的师傅。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:01.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I've been the last one out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:01.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我常常是最后一个走的人，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:02.72,EN,,0,0,0,,because of the scheduling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:02.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为赛程安排的关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:04.32,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you to the valet drivers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以谢谢泊车的师傅们，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.32,0:03:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,for staying up past midnight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.32,0:03:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,熬到过了半夜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:07.44,EN,,0,0,0,,to get my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:07.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,还在帮我取车。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:08.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Who else am I missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:08.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还漏了谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:09.92,EN,,0,0,0,,the locker room attendees,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,更衣室的工作人员，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:10.80,EN,,0,0,0,,laundry, everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:10.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,洗衣房的，所有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.80,0:03:12.40,EN,,0,0,0,,that makes this tournament possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.80,0:03:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,让这届赛事得以举行的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:14.72,EN,,0,0,0,,It truly feel welcomed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:14.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这儿我真的感觉很受欢迎。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:17.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Every time I turn a corner, there's a smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,每次转个弯都能看到笑脸，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.04,0:03:18.80,EN,,0,0,0,,a person saying good morning
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.04,0:03:18.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,有人跟我说早上好，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:20.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and and it really makes my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:20.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,这真的能让我一整天都开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:23.28,EN,,0,0,0,,And thank you to you guys, the fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:23.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,也谢谢你们，谢谢球迷们。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.28,0:03:27.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Like Jess said, this is a tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.28,0:03:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像杰斯说，这是一项赛事，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:29.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I think a lot of the players,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:29.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得很多选手，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.28,0:03:30.56,EN,,0,0,0,,especially us American players,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.28,0:03:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是我们美国选手，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.56,0:03:31.84,EN,,0,0,0,,sign the most because there's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.56,0:03:31.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,这儿的签名，我们签得最多，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:34.80,EN,,0,0,0,,so many heartfelt stories and voices
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:34.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,有太多真挚的故事和声音，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:37.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and gifts that you guys have given me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:37.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有你们送我的礼物。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:38.40,EN,,0,0,0,,actually like two times
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话，这一周
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:40.40,EN,,0,0,0,,this this week I I like cried
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:40.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我有两次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:42.32,EN,,0,0,0,,in my room just from all the support
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:42.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,一个人在房间里哭了，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:43.28,EN,,0,0,0,,that I was getting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:43.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是因为收到的这些支持。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:45.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Just some of the stories
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,有人跟我讲过一些故事，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:47.12,EN,,0,0,0,,that people have been sharing with me how
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:47.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,说的是我赢球或输球，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:48.96,EN,,0,0,0,,my tennis win or lose gives them joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:48.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,怎么能给他们带来快乐。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:50.80,EN,,0,0,0,,It just makes me so happy to be out here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,这让我特别开心能站在这儿，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:51.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and fight every moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一分都全力去打。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:53.52,EN,,0,0,0,,So thank you guys for supporting me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:53.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们支持我，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and supporting us
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,支持我们，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.28,0:03:58.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and I hope I didn't forget anything else
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.28,0:03:58.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望我没漏掉什么，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:00.32,EN,,0,0,0,,but yeah thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:00.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,总之，谢谢大家。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,And I'll see you guys next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,明年再见。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:04.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:06.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Coco, will you stand right here and hold
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,高芙，能不能站到这儿，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:07.52,EN,,0,0,0,,that trophy up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:07.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,把奖杯举起来？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:08.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:08.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,女士们，先生们，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.32,0:04:10.96,EN,,0,0,0,,may I present to you your 2026 Cincinnati
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.32,0:04:10.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,请允许我介绍你们的 2026
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:13.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Open Women's Singles Champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提公开赛女单冠军，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:15.58,EN,,0,0,0,,Coco Gauff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:15.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,高芙。
